<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech c.bank 13-wk bill gross yield 13.48 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech c.bank 13-wk bill gross yield 13.48 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gross yields in a Dutch auction of eight billion crowns of 13-week Czech National Bank liquidity bills edged down to 13.48 percent from a previous 13.50 percent, the CNB said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The CNB said total bids hit 9.283 billion crowns, of which 7.999 billion were accepted. Net yield was 10.11 percent.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
